TOKEN tinybird_read_public READ
TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
Catalog health for official models and agents: final 2xx and 5xx requests per
model over the last 24 hours, counted at hour grain, so the window spans 24 to
25 hours. Fallback rescues are successes for the requested model; caller 4xx
are excluded. Rows match the `model_route_health` rollup shape.

NODE endpoint
SQL >
    SELECT
        model,
        event_type,
        1 AS is_rollup,
        sumMerge(status_2xx) AS status_2xx,
        sumMerge(errors_5xx) AS errors_5xx
    FROM model_health_hourly
    WHERE hour >= toStartOfHour(now() - INTERVAL 24 HOUR)
    GROUP BY model, event_type

TYPE endpoint
